   "html": "<p>To promote the Searchlight Picture's film and celebrate its release on Hulu, IHC curated a special advanced screening at the Alamo Drafthouse Cinema in DTLA. </p>\n<p>We curated a guest list of influencers, film fans and musical fanatics to attend the early screening, with an introduction by cast member <strong>Austin Crute</strong>. For the afterparty, <strong>DJ Muezette</strong> set the groovy vibe and <strong>The Cobrasnake </strong>was onsite to capture the night. </p>"
  }
 ],
 "sections": [
  {
   "title": "screening & after party",
   "pieces": [
    {
     "type": "text",
     "html": "<p>Guests enjoyed custom cocktails ahead of the actual screening along with concessions delivered straight to their seats. After the screening, we brought the party to Let's Go Disco where DJ Muzette played an inspired mix of indie and dance hits that took cues from the film’s soundtrack. A highlight of the evening was our custom-built, larger-than-life vinyl record backdrop complete with the film title treatment that guests could pose in front of! </p>"
    },
